  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7bcc2503-d785-4d74-9a1e-86b0d35e4787.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"917\" height=\"254\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Просто переименуйте вырезанную тыкву так:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_44238dd1-1e51-4ae2-a022-c16565c41a91.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"352\" height=\"331\"></p><p><strong>Список названий:</strong></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Оружейника</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Мясника</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Картографа</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Клерика</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Пустыни</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Фермера</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Рыбака</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Лучника</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Джунглей</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Кожевника</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Библиотекаря</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Каменщика</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Равнины</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Саванны</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Пастуха</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Снега</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Болота</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Тайги</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Инструментальщика</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Шляпа_Оружейника</strong></li>\n</ul><hr><p><strong>1.21.5+ Нет необходимости устанавливать моды</strong></p><p><strong>Для версий 1.21.4 и ниже требуется CIT</strong>:<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cit-resewn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Custom Item Textures</a> или<strong> </strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a><br><br><br><em>Отключите 3D-шляпу, если используете</em><strong><em>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skin-layers-3d\" rel=\"nofollow\">3D-слои кожи</a><br></em></strong><strong><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ec74e884-bad4-471f-a928-ddfdbc02b928.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"426\" height=\"322\"></em></strong></p><p>*<em>Этот ресурсный пакет также работает в Vanilla Minecraft<br><br></em></p><p><strong>Все мои дополнения для Mizuno.</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno Better Leaves</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Неофициальные Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-connected-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Connected Texture</a><br></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-x-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x Fresh Animations</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-dark-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Темный режим Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Связанное стекло Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-eating-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Анимация еды Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-better-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Лучшая трава Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-hat-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Варианты шляп Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-copper-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Медные инструменты Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-allay-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варианты Allay Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Варианты курицы Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Варианты курицы Mizuno's x FA</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-fox-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варианты лисы Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варианты коровы Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варианты коровы Mizuno's x FA</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варианты свиньи Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варианты свиньи Mizuno's x FA</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">x Farmer's Delight Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-storage-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Storage Delight Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-crate-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Crate Delight Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-frights-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Frights Delight Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-display-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">x Display Delight Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-rustic-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">x Rustic Delight Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-ubes-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Ube's Delight Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-vegan-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">x Vegan Delight Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-handcrafted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">x Handcrafted Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-farm-and-charm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Letsdo Farm & Charm Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Letsdo Furniture Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-bakery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Letsdo Bakery Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-lets-do-meadow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">x Letsdo Meadow Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-reinforced-chest-barrels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Reinforced Chest & Barrels Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>Другой проект:</strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fShorkBee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/130037dd8c972d8573f49d7928b542711e2f6ed4.png\" alt=\"Ссылка на ShorkBee\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shorkbee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c450b18c2c965d2e2a798f1576231a1f1f37458e_0.webp\" alt=\"Ссылка на ShorkBee\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a></p>",
